Optional local Semgrep rules (not distributed)
---------------------------------------------
The local scanner downloads selected rules from semgrep/semgrep-rules at:
https://github.com/semgrep/semgrep-rules/tree/16b9e6d45f10649f6a531ec4838ed9924372c3bc

Rule bodies are not included in this repository. Their separate upstream terms
apply to local downloads: Semgrep Rules License v1.0,
https://semgrep.dev/legal/rules-license

.security/semgrep-rules.lock.json contains only source paths, rule identifiers
and integrity hashes. Downloaded sources and generated scanner configuration
belong in the ignored .artifacts/ directory and must not be redistributed as
part of this sample.
